# rola-bench's research environment (MODULE.bazel's `environment.python` tag `research_env`): the baselines' stack --
# torch 2.6's CUDA 12.4 build, flash-attn's prebuilt wheel for it (by URL: the release's binary, never a source
# build), upstream flash-linear-attention 0.4.2 -- with zoology and fleet pinned by their public commits beside the
# lock. Versions are the ones the hand-made venv (rola311) was proven with. Compiled with `uv pip compile research.in
# --python-version 3.11 --generate-hashes --extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu124
# --index-strategy unsafe-best-match -o research.lock`.
